Make 2 edits: (1) set the spread of note c1a in its timing group to 1/256; (2) set the velocity of note c2d to 61. Then apply exactly the lifecycle updates the task contract requires for these edits: mark each affected inferred interpretation stale, and leave declared and unaffected interpretations unchanged. Keep each changed group's common delay and group equation. Preserve every other field, membership, order, label and provenance. Do not round values to a grid.
